      "description": "The PUBLISHED SITE, on a CDN that serves files by path only (GitHub Pages). Lives on the `gh-pages` branch, one entry per route (the release root and each `branches/<slug>/` preview); never in the checkout, and `site/` is only where a local build lands. Built by `site-build-local` on a machine and by `pages-publish` in CI (two Tools, one skill, `docs-generation`), and deployed by the Tool `storage.tool` names. `derivedFrom` names the renderable graphs THIS layer can reach; every other layer's docs are composed onto it by `mount-instance-docs.ts`, which a layer below cannot name without pointing upward. Declared here, on the harness that composes the site, rather than as a row in a central table (owner, 2026-10-03 and 2026-10-05: special-branches.json is gone; beans rva2, lehh).",
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-0828/cat-harness/directory/site",
